---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/ui/PageIntro.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice"
  ><PageIntro
    title="Privacy Notice"
    eyebrow="Review Draft"
    intro="This notice describes the current design review website. It must be completed and reviewed before enquiries are enabled or the business site launches."
  /><section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>This review website</h2><p>
        The website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. The contact form is disabled
        and does not accept enquiries. We have not added analytics, advertising
        trackers or a newsletter subscription.
      </p><h2>Third-party links</h2><p>
        Links to WhatsApp, Facebook and Instagram take you to those services. Their own
        privacy terms apply when you visit them.
      </p><h2>Before enquiries are enabled</h2><p>
        The final notice must identify the responsible business and privacy
        contact, explain the purpose and legal basis for processing, describe
        the information collected, recipients and processors, retention,
        relevant international transfers, and the rights and complaint routes
        that apply.
      </p><p>
        Hosting and security logs, any future cookies, anti-spam service and
        mail provider must be assessed for the actual configuration. The
        applicable Kosovo and EU requirements will be reviewed before launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></SiteLayout
>
